    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164580/extras/9d8b2b717e3e3ad7c9a0f1336e51e809.avif?t=1675156710\" /></div><br>Go on a Wonderful Jigsaw Journey and earn Mana to reveal a magical world. Enjoy this interesting puzzle images in this fairy adventure. Play 7 chapters with more than 250 HD levels. This game is 100% perfection, attention is paid to every detail, best in a his kind. Enjoy!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164580/extras/1b57982ecfd819a42a01d0f564481de5.poster.avif?t=1675156710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164580/extras/1b57982ecfd819a42a01d0f564481de5.webm?t=1675156710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164580/extras/1b57982ecfd819a42a01d0f564481de5.mp4?t=1675156710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Puzzle Pieces 5: Fairy Ring is peaceful and relaxing. Each puzzle completed fills the Mana and each puzzle is 100% customizable with so many different puzzle shapes, the number of pieces desired, background, brightness, pictured images, ghosted images.  You'll earn points for completing the puzzle with or without the timer.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164580/extras/141a66b517098df1b231e1b03fb75a89.poster.avif?t=1675156710\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164580/extras/141a66b517098df1b231e1b03fb75a89.webm?t=1675156710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164580/extras/141a66b517098df1b231e1b03fb75a89.mp4?t=1675156710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose whether or not you want a Timer.Uncover the secrets hidden within the Enchanted Forest.<br><br> - 7 chapters with more than 250 HD levels<br> - Solve jigsaws, earn Mana and reveal magical Worlds<br> - Use completed puzzles as HD wallpapers!<br> - Use your own images and save completed puzzles<br> - 100% perfection",
